{"type":"standard","title":"Function composition","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Function composition</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q244761","titles":{"canonical":"Function_composition","normalized":"Function composition","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Function composition</span></span>"},"pageid":195947,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1364316399","tid":"baa4ad03-8096-11f1-825f-3dec0e7bd60d","timestamp":"2026-07-15T21:47:09Z","description":"Operation on mathematical functions","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Function_composition","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Function_composition?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Function_composition?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Function_composition"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Function_composition","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Function_composition","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Function_composition?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Function_composition"}},"extract":"In mathematics, the composition operator  takes two functions,  and , and returns a new function . When the composite function  is evaluated at an input , the result is . That is, the function  is applied after applying  to .","extract_html":"<p>In mathematics, the <b>composition operator</b> <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/99add39d2b681e2de7ff62422c32704a05c7ec31\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:0.125ex;width:1.162ex;height:1.509ex\" /></span> takes two functions, <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/132e57acb643253e7810ee9702d9581f159a1c61\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.671ex;width:1.279ex;height:2.509ex\" /></span> and <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/d3556280e66fe2c0d0140df20935a6f057381d77\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.671ex;width:1.116ex;height:2.009ex\" /></span>, and returns a new function <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/b2f61ca7838709fbae07dce9c0d513770f10cfae\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.671ex;width:4.589ex;height:2.509ex\" /></span>. When the composite function <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/b2f61ca7838709fbae07dce9c0d513770f10cfae\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.671ex;width:4.589ex;height:2.509ex\" /></span> is evaluated at an input <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/87f9e315fd7e2ba406057a97300593c4802b53e4\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.338ex;width:1.33ex;height:1.676ex\" /></span>, the result is <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/09bac32279e79498a14c3f27741d08cf59aac1b3\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.838ex;width:19.979ex;height:2.843ex\" /></span>. That is, the function <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/132e57acb643253e7810ee9702d9581f159a1c61\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.671ex;width:1.279ex;height:2.509ex\" /></span> is applied after applying <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/d3556280e66fe2c0d0140df20935a6f057381d77\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.671ex;width:1.116ex;height:2.009ex\" /></span> to <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/87f9e315fd7e2ba406057a97300593c4802b53e4\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.338ex;width:1.33ex;height:1.676ex\" /></span>.</p>"}